@startuml
title Variant B — Durable timeout and SMS failover
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
participant "Temporal Server\n+ durable history" as T
participant "Workflow Worker" as W
participant "Activity Worker" as A
database "Business registry" as DB
participant "SMS-A" as PA
participant "SMS-B" as PB
participant "Receipt API\n+ signal relay" as R
participant "Mobile app" as App

note over T,App : Push pending. Workflow worker restarts;
note over T,App : history and absolute deadline survive.
T -> W : Replay; push timer fired at t0 + 2 s
alt A valid ACK was recorded before the timer decision
  W -> T : Confirm; cancel pending sends
else No valid confirmation
  W -> T : Schedule SMS-A Activity (target start <= t0 + 3 s)
  T -> A : SMS-A task (polled)
  A -> DB : Reserve stable attempt_id
  A -> PA : Send SMS
  PA --> A : Definitive rejection before acceptance
  A -> DB : Commit FAILED
  A -> T : Activity result: definitive failure
  T -> W : Resume with failure
  W -> T : Schedule SMS-B Activity
  T -> A : SMS-B task (polled)
  A -> DB : Reserve next attempt
  A -> PB : Send SMS
  PB --> A : Accepted + provider_message_id
  A -> DB : Commit WAITING_RECEIPT
  A -> T : Activity completed: accepted
  PB -> R : Signed delivered DLR
  R -> DB : Commit receipt + signal-outbox
  R --> PB : 200 after commit
  R -> T : Durable retry of receipt signal
  T --> R : Signal persisted
  T -> W : Resume with delivery evidence
  W -> T : Confirm; cancel timers; project result
  T -> A : Idempotent projection Activity
  A -> DB : Commit CONFIRMED + audit
  A -> T : Projection complete
  W -> T : Complete workflow
end
App -> R : Late push ACK
R -> DB : Persist late evidence
R -> T : Signal existing workflow only
T --> R : Already closed; do not start again
R -> DB : Mark late receipt handled; keep CONFIRMED
note over T,PB : Activity timeout with unknown provider result requires
note over T,PB : status reconciliation, not a blind automatic resend.
@enduml
